{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2bfa4c3e-b67e-8241-b23c-10c4387c484b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T12:08:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Patrick Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Patrick Brennan. Quick question, is this the department that handles puddles, or do I need the Coast Guard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, we can take puddles. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's a big puddle sitting across about half the road in front of 168 Broadway, up in the North End. And it's not going anywhere. It hasn't rained in three days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three days dry and it's still standing there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Same spot every time I go by. Cars are swinging into the other lane to get around it, which isn't great on that stretch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a storm drain right there, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:06:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a catch basin on the curb, right at the low spot. I can't see any water going into it. It just sits. Honestly I'd say it's not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:06:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And has it been like this for a while, or is it new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:06:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been building for about a week, I'd say. But it wasn't this bad last winter. We'd get water after a rain and it'd be gone by the next day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Hang on one second, let me put this in. [pause] Sorry, go ahead, I'm typing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:06:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry, I thought you were talking to me. Was that you who just said something about the truck schedule?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that was Marcy at the next desk, she's on another call. You're stuck with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, okay. Your voices are close. Anyway, nothing urgent on my end, I just want it looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So that's 168 Broadway, catch basin by the curb not draining, standing water across about half the lane, dry weather. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:07:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:07:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll open a work order for a crew to inspect the basin and see if it's clogged or if there's a bigger line issue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Can you tell me what date it's likely to get done? Or at least, will I get a work order number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:07:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'll get a number, yes. As for the date, inspections like this usually get scheduled within the next few days to a week. I'll mark it as a road hazard since it's pushing traffic over the line, which helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:08:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. Do you want a number for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, what's the best callback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:08:13-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:08:14-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five one. Perfect. I'll have the order number read to you if someone calls, and if you don't hear anything by early next week, call back and give us this address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Patrick. Enjoy your lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:08:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
